  "contentHtml": "<p>재미있는&#160;과학수업&#160;만들기&#160;1만&#160;4천&#160;회원&#160;여러분! <br><br>오늘도&#160;아낌없는&#160;교육정보&#160;나눔에&#160;감사드립니다. <br>저희&#160;재과만이&#160;보다&#160;신뢰롭고,&#160;신속한&#160;정보&#160;나눔을&#160;위해&#160; <br>회원정보&#160;수정&#160;안건을&#160;운영진회의에서&#160;논의하고&#160; <br>그&#160;결과를&#160;공지합니다.</p><p><br>1.&#160;회원&#160;닉네임&#160;수정 <br>회원들&#160;간에&#160;보다&#160;신뢰로운&#160;카페가&#160;될&#160;수&#160;있도록 <br>성함(학교명&#160;or&#160;지역)으로&#160;수정해주십시오. <br>작성&#160;예시&#160;:&#160;김영학(운암고),&#160;김영학(경기도) <br><br>2.&#160;회원&#160;정보에&#160;휴대폰&#160;번호&#160;입력 <br>재과만&#160;행사&#160;안내&#160;및&#160;각종&#160;이벤트,&#160;교육정보&#160;등을&#160;휴대폰&#160;문자로&#160;보다&#160;빨리&#160;알려드립니다. <br><br>더욱&#160;신뢰로운&#160;플랫폼, <br>신속한&#160;정보나눔의&#160;플랫폼이&#160;되고자&#160;합니다. <br>1만&#160;4천명&#160;회원&#160;여러분의&#160; <br>적극적인&#160;회원정보&#160;수정에&#160; <br>동참&#160;부탁드립니다.&#160; <br><br>고맙습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>------------------------------------- 다음은 회원정보 수정 방법입니다 :) ------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>1. 재과만 카페에 들어갑니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e36b465a8570aa13459012c648ed77b06520dddc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e36b465a8570aa13459012c648ed77b06520dddc\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>2. 카페 하단으로 갑니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8d2d0d7c196818244b6c8c63aaedba26737abbf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8d2d0d7c196818244b6c8c63aaedba26737abbf\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>3. 내 정보를 클릭한 후, 카페 활동 이미지 옆 연필 모양을 클릭합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/994e62b5d376fe97899680b2de734e796f064a9f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/994e62b5d376fe97899680b2de734e796f064a9f\" data-origin-width=\"1283\" data-origin-height=\"723\"></div><p>4. 닉네임을 실명(학교명)으로 설정합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00c71ac9372f3f0890d788a3b549e14e5e7fd41c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00c71ac9372f3f0890d788a3b549e14e5e7fd41c\" data-origin-width=\"1281\" data-origin-height=\"715\"></div><p>5. 주관식 질문에 답변을 작성합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c7e7c88740058de6154ffd4524e7eb4f5fdd0be\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c7e7c88740058de6154ffd4524e7eb4f5fdd0be\" data-origin-width=\"1283\" data-origin-height=\"725\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
